        "summary":  "Intuit developed EWOK Agent, an AI-powered disaster recovery assistant built on Amazon Bedrock that automates failover decisions and execution for their multi-region infrastructure. The system encodes failover knowledge as typed \u0027skills\u0027 and uses a bounded agentic loop where the model decides what to do while the agent deterministically executes how, reducing recovery times from hours to approximately 20 minutes. Human engineers remain in a supervisory role throughout.",
